{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned","id":17821,"title":"Have a lot of people been banned?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-25T11:18:53-08:00","id":17821,"title":"Have a lot of people been banned?","content":"Hey I've noticed posters with banned under their status , and over the month the forum has been up I think I've seen at least 4 banned posters. Have a lot of the peoples just been breaking rules? Is this expected to simmer down as people get used to the forums?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T11:24:13-08:00","id":17823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned#post17821\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey I've noticed posters with banned under their status , and over the month the forum has been up I think I've seen at least 4 banned posters. Have a lot of the peoples just been breaking rules? Is this expected to simmer down as people get used to the forums?</div> </div> </div> </div>One would hope so.<br /> <br /> They could also be temporary bans. Unfortunately we don't know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T11:28:59-08:00","id":17829,"title":"","content":"Oh that would make sense if they were temporary, I haven't after all seen anything besides, Memeber, Moderator and Banned, so if Banned cover the whole gamut then I guess maybe some people are just meeting temporary suspensions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T12:53:12-08:00","id":17866,"title":"","content":"Banned covers both temporary and permanent time frames. We don't talk about bans, but as all users are able to see that title now I will say, we are seeing no more or less activity than normal. That's all I can or will say on the subject.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T14:01:55-08:00","id":17915,"title":"","content":"Oh I'm sorry is it okay for this to even be thread? I was wondering if it was okay to talk about bans in general rather then specific ones. We can close this thread if its a no no. Its less concerning now that I know its not permanent bans, and that its not an unusual amount of banning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T16:00:29-08:00","id":17991,"title":"","content":"Discussing policies and procedures is fine. We're happy to give you guys some insights into our processes. We mostly keep it under wraps because discussion about moderator action can get out of control due to wacky assumptions and because we prefer a slap on the wrist to a public flogging.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b> Onyx Path Forum Moderator</b></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Read the rules</a><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">This is my mod voice.</span></b><br /> This is not my mod voice.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9-sparketh","name":"Sparketh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9_2.png",