kind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T18:36:45-08:00","id":18074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amaterasu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=18027#post18027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's slightly better than all their posts randomly disappearing and threads suddenly becoming odd one-less-sided affairs.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm willing to bet a paycheck that continues to happen. I'm a fan of visible moderation. If you leave shit up that got someone banned (sans things like racial slurs and the ilk) you show people what is not acceptable. They see it themslves, even after it happened. Deleting it just makes it invisible and allows others to repeat the same thing.<br /> <br /> What I mean by that isn't the deletion of all of their posts, just the one that caused the mod action.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":372,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","user":"cerealkiller","date":".  clarification 11-26-2013, 01:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T19:37:36-08:00","id":18111,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amaterasu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=18027#post18027\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's slightly better than all their posts randomly disappearing and threads suddenly becoming odd one-less-sided affairs.</div> </div> </div> </div>Did that typically happen on the old forums? From what I remember, all their posts stayed up and such, there was just no more activity from that account. Usually I only knew somebody was banned because another poster mentioned it, or because I asked.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16-cielle","name":"Cielle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T21:08:08-08:00","id":18144,"title":"","content":"Frequently we would edit out the problematic parts of a post and just leave something like &quot;Mod edit.&quot; in bold red letters in it's place. If I was feeling particularly cheeky I'd personalize it by saying something like &quot;personal attacks are bad, mmmkay.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">They call me... Mr. Demmywinks.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1210-demetrius7997","name":"Demetrius7997","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"81"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-25T21:25:03-08:00","id":18149,"title":"","content":"Sorry...was iced bound in Austin, no Bingo...no Vikings (can't find the PS2) but I got to watch Doctor Who twice with my daughter so if there were any rumors about me being banned, they're false. I also got a 70's stove to functioning again (got to love old apartments). Also got my Mom's scarf done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T06:33:02-08:00","id":18376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JadedTrueBrujah</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=18149#post18149\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there were any rumors about me being banned, they're false.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm pretty sure no one said that, and I'm as sure as I can be without gaining telepathic powers that no one thought it, either. If you'd been banned, the word &quot;Member&quot; beneath your avatar would have been replaced with the word &quot;Banned.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T12:00:25-08:00","id":18585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=18074#post18074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm willing to bet a paycheck that continues to happen. I'm a fan of visible moderation. If you leave shit up that got someone banned (sans things like racial slurs and the ilk) you show people what is not acceptable. They see it themslves, even after it happened. Deleting it just makes it invisible and allows others to repeat the same thing.<br /> <br /> What I mean by that isn't the deletion of all of their posts, just the one that caused the mod action.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can assure you that deleted posts will continue to be a thing. We'll also make a habit of leaving something in it's place. Oftentimes, the posts we remove are problematic in that they will ruin an otherwise productive discussion. If there's enough of a problem, we're more likely to lock it down and kill the conversation.<br /> <br /> As for the things that aren't tolerated, we've got a list already. We call it them the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\">Forum Rules</a>.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b> Onyx Path Forum Moderator</b></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Read the rules</a><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">This is my mod voice.</span></b><br /> This is not my mod voice.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9-sparketh","name":"Sparketh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T01:29:44-08:00","id":19036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=18074#post18074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm willing to bet a paycheck that continues to happen. I'm a fan of visible moderation. If you leave shit up that got someone banned (sans things like racial slurs and the ilk) you show people what is not acceptable. They see it themslves, even after it happened. Deleting it just makes it invisible and allows others to repeat the same thing.<br /> <br /> What I mean by that isn't the deletion of all of their posts, just the one that caused the mod action.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I prefer more transparent moderation, but it's not my sandbox.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/137x125q90/745/a5GS5M.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/802-amaterasu","name":"amaterasu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar802_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"208"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T01:47:37-08:00","id":19044,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>amaterasu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=19036#post19036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I prefer more transparent moderation, but it's not my sandbox.</div> </div> </div> </div>yeah I'm not going to try to start a campaign to get them to change how they do things because it offends me or anything (it doesn't offend me). Was just stating how I see things and how I like things. I know they won't always match up with everyone's ideas. <br /> <br /> Sparketh, for clarification's sake, I know we have forum rules, they are pretty good rules over all. The thing is, not everything that will cause problems falls into those rules and sometimes action must be taken that doesn't fall directly into the rules. My point being, these things can be a bit outlier than others and may not warrant an addition to the rules but leaving it visible for others rather than deletion will demonstrate what behavior, that doesn't fit inside the mold the rules have created, isn't tolerated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T17:48:14-08:00","id":19460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>cerealkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=19044#post19044\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sparketh, for clarification's sake, I know we have forum rules, they are pretty good rules over all. The thing is, not everything that will cause problems falls into those rules and sometimes action must be taken that doesn't fall directly into the rules. My point being, these things can be a bit outlier than others and may not warrant an addition to the rules but leaving it visible for others rather than deletion will demonstrate what behavior, that doesn't fit inside the mold the rules have created, isn't tolerated.</div> </div> </div> </div>In the event that the rules don't allow for effective moderation, there is a rule for that.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-size:15px\">XX.</span></b></span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Onyx Path or the moderators may find it necessary to modify posts or curtail user privileges for circumstances not listed above. If we find ourselves taking action in response to a particular, repeated abuse, we may, again at our discretion, add it to the rules above.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> And like I said, sometimes we just lock the thread and put in a warning because that tree is beyond pruning. We also make it clear to the user who caused us to invoke the above that the behavior is not welcome and that there will be consequences.<br /> <br /> That being said, we're generally careful about invoking Rule XX so that it can fill it's role without invalidating the need for the more standard rules. The majority of the time it is invoked, a new or revised rule gets announce.<br /> <br /> We also use it for when the blood on the banhammers gets dry and flaky. That is SO embarrassing.<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b> Onyx Path Forum Moderator</b></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Read the rules</a><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">This is my mod voice.</span></b><br /> This is not my mod voice.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9-sparketh","name":"Sparketh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"201"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T08:03:37-08:00","id":20187,"title":"","content":"Sounds like I better play nice then....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1399-lord_boofhead","name":"Lord_Boofhead","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1399_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-29T08:29:01-08:00","id":20197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lord_Boofhead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/17821-have-a-lot-of-people-been-banned?p=20187#post20187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sounds like I better play nice then....</div> </div> </div> </div>Why start now? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />